  <data name="label25.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Stored settings will be automatically downloaded upon successful connection.
Changes made in the configuration utility are only local memory changes until settings are saved to the controller.
If changes have been made, the Save Settings button color changes to RED as a reminder to SAVE them.  
Changes can be abandoned/discarded by disconnecting or closing the utility.

Clear Flash Memory sets all 256k memory locations to 0.  After clearing the memory a Factory Reset must be performed.

Factory Reset can be run without having to clear the memory first.  Restored settings are automatically loaded after a successful reset.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="label26.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Enable Nudging -  Enables/Disables Nudge Feature       Sensitivity - the lower the number, the faster the response at a cost of smoothness
Axis Deadzone - removes ' jitter'  from nudge sensor at rest         Axis Gain - amplifies nudge sensor readings (expressed as a multiplier)
Debounce Time - the period of time that the Tilt signal is ignored between strikes.  Value set is multiplied x10 (range of 0 - 2.5seconds)</value>
  </data>
  <data name="label24.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Select Gamepad Button to set, Select the Button Usage and the Keypress to assign to it and click Apply to set in memory.
                  Return to the Start screen and click the Send Button to save the changes to the controller memory.</value>
  </data>
